OL,3,GNEWSACost of Noah Donohoe inquest to
OL,4,Apublic purse revealed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe inquest into the death of Noah
OL,7,FDonohoe cost about #3.9m of public
OL,8,Fmoney, according to figures released to
OL,9,Fthe BBC.
OL,11,FDonohoe was 14 when he went missing
OL,12,Ffrom his home in Belfast in June 2020
OL,13,Fand was found six days later in a
OL,14,Fculvert on the other side of the city.
OL,16,FEyewitnesses, who were the last to see
OL,17,Fhim in the vicinity of the culvert,
OL,18,Freported that he was naked.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
